/P 66 0 R
/T (The Department of Statistics and Data Science at IIT Kanpur, carrying forward a distinguished academic legacy established in 1970, is a premier center for education in statistics, data science, machine learning, and artificial intelligence. Formerly part of the Department of Mathematics and Statistics, it now stands independently to focus on statistical theory and computational methods. Our BS in Statistics and Data Science and MSc in Statistics offer rigorous theoretical and applied training, preparing students for impactful careers in academia, industry, and research.)
/E (The Department of Statistics and Data Science at IIT Kanpur, carrying forward a distinguished academic legacy established in 1970, is a premier center for education in statistics, data science, machine learning, and artificial intelligence. Formerly part of the Department of Mathematics and Statistics, it now stands independently to focus on statistical theory and computational methods. Our BS in Statistics and Data Science and MSc in Statistics offer rigorous theoretical and applied training, preparing students for impactful careers in academia, industry, and research.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
